    "body": "After reviewing this again, we should not break compatibility for an already released REST API behavior. Missing `filter` currently behaves the same as an explicit empty filter, and this is not a real server-side bug that warrants a breaking validation change.\n\nI will revert the `filter`-required change from the PR and keep only the #49843 enhancement that rejects invalid TTL values on REST create collection.",
